# anbernic tracker song
# The five VOX styles side by side, for tests/difftest.sh: no song in
# moondaw/songs uses SOFT, MELO or SINGR. One track a style, the same
# lyric on each, every sign of the alphabet somewhere in it; the tract,
# the English accent, a melisma, a syllable struck over a slide, a coda
# closed by an OFF and by the next note, an unstressed mark, a syllable
# with no vowel, SINGR's own vibrato and an fVIB that silences it.
version 3
bpm 110
ticks 6
meter 4 4
tracks 5
reverb 64 64
delay 18 60

inst 00 engine VOX timbre 0 adsr 0 20 230 30 name GLIDE
inst 01 engine VOX timbre 1 adsr 0 20 230 30 tract 130 name HARD
inst 02 engine VOX timbre 2 adsr 4 20 230 40 tract 85 accent EN name SOFT
inst 03 engine VOX timbre 3 adsr 0 20 230 30 accent EN name MELO
inst 04 engine VOX timbre 4 adsr 6 30 230 50 tract 72 name SINGR

trk 0 vol 100 pan 0
trk 1 vol 100 pan 0
trk 2 vol 100 pan 0
trk 3 vol 100 pan 0
trk 4 vol 100 pan 0

pat t0 00 len 64
00 A-2 i00 'B8I
04 C-3 'K4T
08 D-3 'STAP
0C E-3 'PL
10 G-3 '.+2
14 A-3 'MI fSLI20
16 C-4
18 D-4 'Q7U
1C OFF
20 E-3 'G6 fSLI00
24 G-3 'F1L
28 A-3 'XED
2C C-4 'Z9R
30 D-4 'J0N
34 E-4 'V3W
38 G-4 'HY5
3C OFF

